key: API-7
format: jira

Paginate the orders endpoint

GET /orders returns every order at once. See the API guide (https://example.com/api).
Reported by @Dana

Current behaviour

- No limit parameter
  - large shops time out
- No cursor

    func List(ctx context.Context) ([]Order, error)
    // returns all

Param | Default
limit | 50

Acceptance criteria:
- limit defaults to 50 and is capped at 200
- the response has a next cursor
